This project incorporates material from LocklyHA
(https://github.com/Forcky/LocklyHA), Copyright (c) 2024 Patrick Forck, under
the MIT License (see LICENSE.LocklyHA):
 - locklyctl/protocol.py — the crypto, BLE framing and response parsers are
   ported from LocklyHA's api.py, where they are validated on real hardware.
 - locklyctl/certs/ — the Lockly application's shared MQTT client certificate,
   CA and key (CN=com.lockly), identical to the copies LocklyHA distributes and
   present in every app install. Not a user secret.

